// Which button clicked a tray icon: StatusNotifierItem's Activate,
// SecondaryActivate and ContextMenu, which are the three things an item can be
// asked to do.
//
// An enum rather than a `DOMString` for DomicileTheme's reason: it is
// *written* -- activateTrayItem() takes it -- and a string would let a shell
// hand the compositor a word no item answers, which would travel all the way
// to the socket before anything asked. The bindings refuse it here instead.
//
// ORDER. Written in `mojom::TrayAction`'s, which is numbered by position.

enum DomicileTrayAction {
  "primary",
  "secondary",
  "context",
};
